RD_MOD_CARD_TEST25.description:
Discard your [gold]Hand[/gold].
Next turn, draw that many additional cards.{InCombat:
(Draws {CalculatedCards:diff()} {CalculatedCards:plural:additional card|additional cards})|}

RD_MOD_CARD_TEST32.description:
[gold]Exhaust[/gold] all Status cards in your [gold]Hand[/gold].
Gain {StrengthPower:diff()} [gold]Strength[/gold] for each card Exhausted.{InCombat:
(Gains {CalculatedStrength:diff()} [gold]Strength[/gold])|}

RD_MOD_CARD_TEST53.description:
Only playable after playing cards with a total cost of at least 7{energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)} this turn.
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to ALL enemies and gain {Energy:energyIcons()}.{InCombat:
(Current total Energy cost: {EnergyTotal})|}

RD_MOD_CARD_TEST56.description:
Put ALL your Status cards into your [gold]Hand[/gold].
Then deal {Damage:diff()} damage for each Status card in your [gold]Hand[/gold].{InCombat:
(Puts {CalculatedCardsDrawn:diff()} {CalculatedCardsDrawn:plural:card|cards} into your [gold]Hand[/gold]; hits {CalculatedHits:diff()} {CalculatedHits:plural:time|times})|}

RD_MOD_CARD_TEST74.description:
Consume 1 [gold]Charge[/gold] to draw {Cards:diff()} {Cards:plural:card|cards} and gain {Block:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold].
Repeat until your [gold]Hand[/gold] is full or you have no [gold]Charge[/gold] left.{InCombat:
(Repeats {CalculatedRepeats:diff()} {CalculatedRepeats:plural:time|times})|}

RD_MOD_CARD_TEST88.description:
Discard your [gold]Hand[/gold].
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to a random enemy for each card discarded.{InCombat:
(Hits {CalculatedHits:diff()} {CalculatedHits:plural:time|times})|}
